{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/970053-sorcery-and-enlightened-science-pertaining-to-computers","id":970053,"title":"Sorcery and Enlightened Science pertaining to computers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-15T11:13:01-07:00","id":970053,"title":"Sorcery and Enlightened Science pertaining to computers","content":"So while reading book of the Wyrm and the dubiously penned cult Webworks, a cult using the the tools of the Weaver, for the Wyrm yet acting like the Wyld oh and they number in the tens of Thousands are all master hackers and can also script occult viruses..., I was thinking what sorcery and Enlightened Science paths would you use for hacking? Most of the freats seem like rituals, and I would imagine we would need unique ones created, but what already there paths do they use. My mind goes first to the Binding/Warding/Summoning, but what else? Would some be esoteric uses of Alchemy and Conveyance? We could use more on technomagic in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T11:23:55-07:00","id":970063,"title":"","content":"If reading the laundry files have taught me anything, it's that math can be used as a focus. Since computers run on math that same applies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-15T11:42:16-07:00","id":970073,"title":"","content":"Well yes I know about computers being the focus, what I'm talking about is effects that specifically apply to computers like viruses and data inception.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T20:13:22-07:00","id":972299,"title":"","content":"There's the Cyberkinesis/Cyberpathy Psychic Numina. Enchantment to trick out your hardware. Divination to anticipate problems before they occur, Fortune to prevent system errors from happening. Some modified Oneiromancy rituals might be able to access the Digital Web rather than the Maya.<br /> <br /> Edit: Oh, and use of Synergy to combine Cyberkinesis/Cyberpathy with other things like Clairvoyance might have interesting effects as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6072,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6072-quantumboost","user":"Quantumboost","date":". 09-18-2016, 11:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6072-quantumboost","name":"Quantumboost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6072_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"590"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T20:20:42-07:00","id":972301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Quantumboost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/970053-sorcery-and-enlightened-science-pertaining-to-computers?p=972299#post972299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's the Cyberkinesis/Cyberpathy Psychic Numina. Enchantment to trick out your hardware. Divination to anticipate problems before they occur, Fortune to prevent system errors from happening. Some modified Oneiromancy rituals might be able to access the Digital Web rather than the Maya.<br /> <br /> Edit: Oh, and use of Synergy to combine Cyberkinesis/Cyberpathy with other things like Clairvoyance might have interesting effects as well.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks these are what I'm looking for!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}